msgid ""
"FawryPay Express Checkout: customers pay on Fawry's hosted checkout.\n"
"Server-to-Server APIs: cards are saved on Fawry's secure card page and charged by Odoo with 3-D Secure, and Fawry reference codes, mobile wallets and myFawry are created by Odoo and shown on your website. Other methods always use the hosted checkout."
