"Payment provider for Fawry (FawryPay). Choose FawryPay Express Checkout, "
"where customers pay on Fawry's hosted checkout in a full page, a pop-up or a"
" side panel, or the Server-to-Server APIs, where cards are saved on Fawry's "
"secure card page and charged with 3-D Secure, and Fawry reference codes, "
"wallet QR codes and myFawry payments are shown on your website. Includes "
"saved cards that customers manage on the website, bank installments, payment"
